---
layout: base.njk
title: "Thoughts · Raghav Kohli"
permalink: /thoughts/
---
{#- The journal: a composer anyone can write in (a title bar, the thought, a name), then every earlier
    thought as a white post-it on the board below, newest first — live posts from the worker (main.js
    initWall) and the markdown entries in src/thoughts/ together. With the owner key the notes can be
    dragged, scaled from the corner and given images; where they are put is kept by the worker
    (data-id is the note's key there — a markdown slug or a live id). Without JS, or before the API
    is configured, the markdown entries stand on their own in the flow. -#}
<section class="detail journal">
  <a class="detail__back" href="/">(&larr; home)</a>
  <span class="detail__qlabel">(thoughts)</span>
  <h1 class="detail__q reveal">a journal, of sorts.</h1>
  <p class="journal__note reveal">open to anyone. write a thought and it is on the page.</p>

  {% if site.thoughtsApi %}
  <form class="composer reveal" data-composer hidden>
    <input class="composer__title" name="title" type="text" maxlength="80" placeholder="a title (optional)" autocomplete="off" />
    <textarea name="body" rows="4" maxlength="2000" placeholder="a thought…" required></textarea>
    <div class="composer__row">
      <input name="name" type="text" maxlength="40" placeholder="your name (optional)" autocomplete="off" />
      <div class="composer__ts" data-turnstile></div>
      {#- images, with the key only: picked here, downscaled in the browser, shown as thumbnails until posted -#}
      <label class="composer__pick" data-pick hidden>(+ image)<input type="file" accept="image/*" multiple hidden /></label>
      <button type="submit">(post)</button>
    </div>
    <div class="composer__imgs" data-imgs></div>
    <p class="composer__msg" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </form>
  {% endif %}

  {#- the board: each thought is a note — title, body, the date at its foot -#}
  <div class="journal__list board" data-wall data-api="{{ site.thoughtsApi }}" data-turnstile-key="{{ site.turnstileKey }}">
    {% for t in collections.thoughts %}
    <article class="thought reveal" id="{{ t.fileSlug }}" data-id="{{ t.fileSlug }}" data-created="{{ t.date.getTime() }}">
      <h2 class="thought__title"><a href="{{ t.url }}">{{ t.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <div class="thought__body">{{ t.templateContent | safe }}</div>
      <span class="thought__date">{{ t.date | day }}</span>
    </article>
    {% else %}
    <p class="thought__empty" data-empty>nothing written yet.</p>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% if site.thoughtsApi %}
  <p class="journal__foot"><a href="#" data-owner-key>(key)</a></p>
  {% endif %}
</section>
{% if site.thoughtsApi and site.turnstileKey %}<script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js?render=explicit" async defer></script>{% endif %}
